From: petronijevicm <71526010+petronijevicm@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Motion Assist built-in motion cues

Drives the platform MotionCuesUi overlay from on-device sensor fusion,
configured through Settings.Secure motion_assist_* keys (see the
Settings patch). Adds a Quick Settings tile, built-in cue shapes with
contrast outlines, a high-contrast mode following the status bar tint,
scattered layout, and high refresh rate drawing. On a secure lock
screen, Quick Settings tiles (except the flashlight) now act only after
unlocking.

SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
